  "content": "\n\n<h3><strong>добавляет несколько новых боссов для мода <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/boss-checklist\" rel=\"nofollow\">Boss Checklist</a></strong></h3>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/boss-checklist\" rel=\"nofollow\">Требуется Boss Checklist</a> !!!!!</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>Если вам нравятся битвы с боссами и вы хотите сделать их более визуально привлекательными, рекомендую Mini-Boss Boss Bar, который добавляет полосу здоровья для мини-боссов.</strong></h4>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mini-boss-boss-bars\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mini-Boss Boss Bar</strong></a></span> от&nbsp;<em><strong>theexiiedfeiiow_</strong></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>В настоящее время добавлены боссы из модов:</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Caves</a> (мини-боссы)</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquamirae\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aquamirae</a> (мини-боссы)</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/arcalis-bosses\" rel=\"nofollow\">Arcalis Bosses</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/arphex\" rel=\"nofollow\">Arthropod Phobia Expansion + Horror Bosses</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/astral-dimension\" rel=\"nofollow\">Astral Dimension</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/awakened-bosses\" rel=\"nofollow\">Awakened Bosses</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-minoshroomtaur\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Minoshroomtaur</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/born-in-chaos\" rel=\"nofollow\">Born in Chaos</a> (мини-боссы)</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania\" rel=\"nofollow\">Botania</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/brassamberbattletowers\" rel=\"nofollow\">BrassAmber's Battle Tower</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bosses-unleashed\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bosses Unleashed</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/call-of-drowner\" rel=\"nofollow\">Call of</a><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/call-of-drowner\" rel=\"nofollow\"> Drowner</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-cave-dweller\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cave Dweller</a></span></li>\n<