r:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/koifees-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Koifee's Mobs</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lendercataclysm\" rel=\"nofollow\">L_Ender's Cataclysm</a> (мини-боссы)</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/legionary\" rel=\"nofollow\">Legionary</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/look-eye-of-cthulhu\" rel=\"nofollow\">Look (Eye of Cthulhu)</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/majruszs-progressive-difficulty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Majruz's Progressive Difficulty</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/meet-your-fight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Meet your Fight</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mortality-a-terramity-addon\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mortality - A Terramity Addon</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-iceologer\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mutant Iceologer</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-wolf\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mutant Wolf</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nether-warlord-boss\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nether Warlord Boss</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/new-classic-battle-towers\" rel=\"nofollow\">New Classic Battle Towers</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pigzilla\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pigzilla</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roaring\" rel=\"nofollow\">Roaring</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hellstone-golem\" rel=\"nofollow\">Snow's Bosses: Hellstone Golem</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sons-of-sins\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sons of Sins</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stalwart-dungeons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Stalwart Dungeons</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-john-mod-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">The John Reborn</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-quest-of-entity-303\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Quest of Entity 303</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-undergarden\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Undergarden</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/twilight-forest-final-boss-remake\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twilight Forest Final Boss Remake</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/twilight-forest-final-boss/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&showAlphaFiles=hide\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twilight Forest Final</a><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/twilight-forest-final-boss/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&showAlphaFiles=hide\" rel=\"nofollow\"> Boss</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Обратите внимание, что обновления будут выходить довольно медленно из-за ограниченного времени. Однако, если есть босс, которого вы очень хотели бы видеть в моде, не стесняйтесь оставить комментарий с именем босса и описанием того, как он вызывается, так как я не знаком со всеми модами. Если хотите, чтобы обновления выходили чаще, пожалуйста, оставляйте свои предложения заранее.</span></strong></p>",
